Recorded benchmark inputs live here, one dataset per file.

Empty is a valid state: with no fixtures present the benchmark runs on
synthetic uniform data only. Drop a file in and its cases appear automatically
-- no code change needed.

Naming: points_<name>.json or curves_<name>.json. The kind is in the filename
so the harness can list fixtures without parsing megabytes of JSON.

Format and the list of datasets worth recording:
../../docs/benchmark-fixtures.md
